{"parentUuid":"835336ef-d053-4554-9d1d-4966590573b3","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"25464faf-de35-487d-80c8-05bd17310fd6","agentId":"a00473bf11fbca24d","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014gmHadGrSnv3KRhm3c6dcy","type":"tool_result","content":"  51 ./Game_Demands/\n   4 ./Injury_Comparison/\n   7 ./Injury_Comparison/summary analysis/\n   2 ./Injury_Comparison/summary analysis/templates/\n  25 ./Practice/\n  12 ./Walk/\nPractice/2026_08_05_0900-FC26_P1_08.05.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_07_0910-FC26_P3_08.07.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_14_0910-FC26_P8_08.14.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_10_0905-FC26_P5_08.10.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_19_0910-FC26_P12_08.19.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_21_0930-FC26_P14_08.21.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_31_1750-AUBURN_P1_08.31.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_11_0910-FC26_P6_08.11.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_18_0910-FC26_P11_08.18.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_27_0910-FC26_P18_NST_08.27.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_26_0910-FC26_P17_08.26.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_15_0910-FC26_P9_08.15.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_28_0906-FC26_P19_FF_08.28.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_09_0905-FC26_P4_08.09.26.csv\nPractice/2026_09_04_0900-AUBURN_P5_FF_09.04.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_25_0910-FC26_P16_08.25.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_13_0910-FC26_P7_08.13.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_20_0910-FC26_P13_08.20.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_23_0910-FC26_P15_08.23.26.csv\nPractice/2026_09_01_0818-AUBURN_P2_09.01.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_06_0905-FC26_P2_08.06.26.csv\nPractice/2026_09_03_0935-AUBURN_P4_NST_09.03.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_29_1100-FC26_MOCK_GAME_08.29.26.csv\nPractice/2026_09_02_0855-AUBURN_P3_09.02.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_16_0910-FC26_P10_08.16.26.csv\n---\nPractice/2026_08_05_0900-FC26_P1_08.05.26.csv\n﻿Player Name,Period Name,Period Number,Position Name,Unix Start Time,Unix End Time,Date,Day Name,Activity Name,Average Contact Load,Average Contact Load (session),Average Contact Load Per Minute,Average Contacts,Average Contacts (session),Average Contacts Per Minute,Average Impact Load (session),Average Impacts (session),Average Load Per Contact,Average Player Load (session),Average Throw Count (p\n\n---\n# FA2026 — Fall Camp 2026\n\nBaylor Football applied performance workspace for Fall Camp 2026 and the\n2026 season. Reorganized 2026-08-18. Roster added 2026-08-18.\n\nFolders are numbered by **pipeline stage**, so the data flows top to bottom:\nraw capture → tagging inputs → processed intermediates → deliverables.\n\n```\nFA2026/\n├── _INBOX/               Drop new files here to be filed\n├── 00_Docs/              Specs, documentation, reference data\n│   └── Roster/             2026 roster: PDF, CSV, XLSX\n├── 01_Raw_GPS/           Catapult exports, untouched\n│   ├── Practice/           10 sessions (P1–P10)\n│   └── Walk/               9 walk-throughs\n├── 02_Raw_Tagging/       Video tagging + practice scripts, untouched\n│   ├── Source_JSON/        FC01–FC10 tagging exports\n│   ├── Scripts/            Practice call sheets by date\n│   └── Practice_Plans/     Phase / period plans with proposed times\n├── 03_Processed/         Machine-generated intermediates (regenerable)\n│   └── TS_Breakdown/       Period / play / practice structure\n├── 04_Outputs/           Dashboards + deliverables. Start here.\n├── 05_Opponents/         Opponent scouting briefs (see its own README)\n├── _Archive/             Superseded versions, kept for reference\n├── _Mark_for_Deletion/   Staged for your review, then delete\n└── _Tools/               The file router + naming rules\n```\n\n## Where to start\n\n| I want to... | Go to |\n|---|---|\n| See camp load and density | `04_Outputs/Baylor_FB_Camp_Density_Dashboard.xlsx` |\n| See the integrated dataset | `04_Outputs/Baylor_FB_Camp_Integrated.xlsx` |\n| Forecast upcoming load | `04_Outputs/Baylor_FB_Practice_Load_Forecast.xlsx` |\n| Check practice structure | `04_Outputs/Baylor_FB_Camp_Practice_Structure_2026.xlsx` |\n| Read the master grid | `04_Outputs/FallCamp2026_GRID.xlsx` |\n| Understand the data model | `00_Docs/Practice_Load_Data_Spec.docx` |\n| Look up a player | `00_Docs/Roster/2026_BU_Roster.xlsx` |\n| Scout the next opponent | `05_Opponents/` |\n\n## Filing new files\n\nDrop anything new in `_INBOX/`, then double-click `_Tools\\Sort_Inbox.bat`.\nThe router reads an UPPERCASE tag on the front of the filename and files it.\n\n| Tag | Goes to | | Tag | Goes to |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| `GPS_P_` | `01_Raw_GPS/Practice` | | `OUT_` | `04_Outputs` |\n| `GPS_W_` | `01_Raw_GPS/Walk` | | `OPP_W##_Team_MM.DD.YY_` | `05_Opponents/<week>` |\n| `TAG_` | `02_Raw_Tagging/Source_JSON` | | `DOC_` | `00_Docs` |\n| `SCRIPT_` | `02_Raw_Tagging/Scripts` | | `ROSTER_` | `00_Docs/Roster` |\n| `PLAN_` | `02_Raw_Tagging/Practice_Plans` | | `ARCHIVE_` | `_Archive` |\n| `PROC_` | `03_Processed` | | `DELETE_` | `_Mark_for_Deletion` |\n| `TSB_` | `03_Processed/TS_Breakdown` | | | |\n\nThe tag is a prefix, so `GPS_P_2026_08_17_0910-FC26_P11_08.17.26.csv` keeps\ndate-first sorting intact inside the folder.\n\n../_INBOX:\nOC_Call.pdf\nREADME.md\n\n../_Tools:\n_build\n_logs\nAdd_Period_Length_Sheet.ps1\nAudit_Names.bat\nbuild_period_length_sheet.py","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"49935d47-5c05-4162-81df-7ac3b17d1014","timestamp":"2026-09-13T20:08:12.050Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"  51 ./Game_Demands/\n   4 ./Injury_Comparison/\n   7 ./Injury_Comparison/summary analysis/\n   2 ./Injury_Comparison/summary analysis/templates/\n  25 ./Practice/\n  12 ./Walk/\nPractice/2026_08_05_0900-FC26_P1_08.05.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_07_0910-FC26_P3_08.07.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_14_0910-FC26_P8_08.14.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_10_0905-FC26_P5_08.10.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_19_0910-FC26_P12_08.19.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_21_0930-FC26_P14_08.21.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_31_1750-AUBURN_P1_08.31.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_11_0910-FC26_P6_08.11.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_18_0910-FC26_P11_08.18.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_27_0910-FC26_P18_NST_08.27.26.csv\nPractice/2026_08_26_0910-FC26_P17_08.26.26.csv\nPractice